Document Recording Standards
Documents to be recorded must meet the recording standards in accordance with N.C.G.S. 161-14 (b).
Read More
Electronic Recording Vendors
Information on electronic recording vendors for businesses that prefer to electronically file documents for recording.
Read More
Fee Schedule
A listing of fees charged for recording services.
Read More
Recording Notification Service
Resource for citizens to receive email notifications when documents are recorded in their name and help avoid being a victim of property fraud.
Read More
Recording Hours
Documents may be recorded Monday - Friday | 8:30am - 4:45pm; except holidays
